{"headline":"छत की धूप से बिजली बिल घटाएँ","primary_text":"अपनी छत से बिजली का बिल घटाने की पहली बात: मुफ़्त साइट सर्वे। आपकी छत कितनी बचत दे सकती है, यह पहले जानें।\nSolaride PM Surya Ghar सब्सिडी और नेट मीटरिंग के कागज़ी काम में मदद करता है। बिजली बिल में संभावित कटौती 98% तक हो सकती है, जो आपकी छत पर निर्भर करता है।\nसाइट सर्वे के बाद आपको अपने घर के लिए साफ़ तस्वीर मिलेगी, ताकि फैसला आप सोच-समझकर लें।","description":"PM Surya Ghar सब्सिडी और नेट मीटरिंग में मदद, साथ में मुफ़्त साइट सर्वे।","cta":"Contact Us","rationale":"The angle is money saved, so the message stays on monthly bill value and the free site survey as the first, low-commitment step. Opening with the survey, not a festival discount, avoids repeating recent Diwali-led copy and tells the reader what happens next. The 98% figure is framed as a potential that depends on the roof, which keeps it honest. A clean rooftop installation in bright daylight shows the product as the source of savings. The family is kept small and secondary so the visual reads as a home's practical benefit, not a generic lifestyle scene.","visual":{"medium":"Architectural photography, natural daylight, realistic colour grade","direction":"A modern single-storey or two-storey house in a Punjab or Haryana setting, photographed from a slightly low eye level across the roofline. The focal subject is a neat, evenly aligned array of dark solar panels on the flat roof, with clean mounting rails and visible tidy cabling kept minimal. Behind the house, a bright clear-sky day with soft white sunlight and a distant band of green fields or low hills gives depth. Below the roof edge, on a shaded terrace or veranda, a small family of three or four sits relaxed at a table, looking toward the house and calm, with genuine rather than posed expressions; they stay small in frame and secondary to the panels. Palette: warm white walls, deep blue-black panels, fresh green foliage, pale sky blue. Keep the upper third of the frame open, uncluttered sky and light, for text. Exclusions: no text, no logos, no watermarks, no lamps or festive decorations, no diyas, no fireworks, no vehicles, no people in the foreground, no artificial glow or heavy HDR effects.","textPlacement":"top"},"supportingText":"फ्री साइट सर्वे, PM Surya Ghar में मदद","sourceQuotes":["Free site survey","Assistance with PM Surya Ghar subsidy and net metering","Potential to cut electricity bills by up to 98%"]}
